request.description:
Loads selected career context, saved chat messages, and dynamic chips for the Ask AI screen without calling the AI model.

Prerequisite: run AI Recommendations first and set {{career_suggestion_id_1}} from a returned top_suggestions/suggestions id.

Response: { success, data: { career_name, suggestion_id, match_percentage, ai_insight, why_this_career, chips, disclaimer, messages } }

