request.description:
Recommended courses for an AI career suggestion.

Requires career_id (CareerSuggestion id for the authenticated user). Optional filters: mode, city_id, course_type, search.

Response: { success, count, message, data: [{ score, courses }] }

Returns inquiries received for courses owned by the authenticated provider.

Requires course_id.

Response: { success, count, data }

Recommended internships for an AI career suggestion.

Requires career_id (CareerSuggestion id for the authenticated user). Optional filters: mode, city_id, search.

Response: { success, count, message, data: [{ score, skill_matches, internship }] }

Returns applications received for jobs owned by the authenticated provider.

Requires job_id.

Response: { success, count, data }

Update application status. Only the job provider can update.

status: applied | under_review | selected | rejected

Response: { success, message, data }

Returns applications received for internships owned by the authenticated provider.

Requires internship_id.

Response: { success, count, data }

Update application status. Only the internship provider can update.

status: applied | under_review | selected | rejected

Response: { success, message, data }
